# HERTZ

Title locked by Kingsley on 19 Oct 2026. Concept confirmed the same day from the November Numerique chat. Working name Echo Ronin + Frequency is retired.

## Fantasy

A boy sees and hears spirits on a private frequency. He liberates the town by clearing the spirit tide so people can live there again. First person.

## Play

- Normal view: the town, spirits not yet a target.
- Frequency flip: spirits become something you can shoot.
- Weapon: dual pistols, only after the flip. Not a blade. Not a score-attack pistol-whip rhythm shooter.
- Feel: exciting, low skill ceiling, spectacle over difficulty. No shame fail states.

## Target

Quest 3S. Unity, OpenXR, XR Interaction Toolkit, action-based input, URP. WebXR is not the product. Keep vendor-specific Quest features behind an adapter.

Personal ship target from that chat: 15 Nov 2026. Do not invent chapters, enemies, or systems that were not locked. Talk design changes through before writing new design docs.
